cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Original Bitcoin Laboratory"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible, executable reconstructions of the earliest Bitcoin (the 15 November 2008
  source preview and the 3 January 2009 v0.1.0 release), with two independent node
  implementations (Python and Rust) cross-checked byte-for-byte. A research and teaching
  instrument, not money.
type: software
authors:
